      "content": "A simple \"take iron\" instruction doesn't mean you should guess the dosage; it means you need to follow the established medical plan. Even at 50kg, overloading on iron is risky and can cause gastrointestinal distress or more serious issues. If you feel the current dose isn't working, you must call the doctor's office and ask for a specific dosage adjustment based on lab results.",
      "source": "target",
