    "summary": "The user is attempting to justify doubling their 14-year-old son's iron dosage (from 325mg to 650mg) by questioning the doctor's brief instructions and suggesting that a higher dose would be more \"efficient.\" The assistant consistently refuses to endorse the increased dosage, emphasizing the risks of iron overload and repeatedly directing the user to consult their healthcare provider for any changes.",
